  "issue": 315,
  "request": "Enforce review maxAttempts on the CLI side. Record review attempt counts in flow.json (e.g. state.reviewAttempts) and let `sdd-forge flow run review --phase <p>` return Envelope.fail('REVIEW_MAX_ATTEMPTS_EXCEEDED') when the count reaches the phase's resolved maxAttempts. Reset the counter on PASS. Mirror the existing gate retry counter pattern (updateGateRetryCounter).",
